Alongside the all-new, higher-end <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/03/03/apple-introduces-studio-display-xdr/">Studio Display XDR</a>, Apple has <a href="https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/03/apple-unveils-new-studio-display-and-all-new-studio-display-xdr/">updated</a> the regular version of the Studio Display with some new features.<br/>
<br/>
